<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     Family Admin v3.0 — Legacy Launcher Icon (API 24-25)
     VectorDrawable Fallback
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     
     Purpose:
     ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
     • Used on Android 7.0-7.1 (API 24-25)
     • These versions don't support Adaptive Icons
     • VectorDrawable works natively (API 21+)
     
     Alternative to PNG:
     ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
     • PNG binaries can't be uploaded via GitHub web editor
     • VectorDrawable = XML = GitHub-compatible
     • Smaller size, scalable, perfect quality
     
     Coverage:
     ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
     • API 24-25:  This file  (VectorDrawable)
     • API 26+:    mipmap-anydpi-v26/ic_launcher.xml  (Adaptive)
     
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-->
